  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p>First term of A.P are&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mn>10</mn></math>, so general term of the first term&nbsp;will be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>i</mi></math></p><p>And common difference are&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo></math>, so general term of common difference&nbsp;is given by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>i</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Now sum of the A.P &nbsp;is given by,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>12</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>12</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>i</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>11</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>i</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>144</mn><mi>i</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>66</mn></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>10</mn></munderover><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>10</mn></munderover><mn>144</mn><mi>i</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>66</mn><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>10</mn></munderover><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>10</mn></munderover><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>144</mn><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>11</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>66</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>10</mn></munderover><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>792</mn><mfenced><mn>10</mn></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>66</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>10</mn></munderover><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>7260</mn></math></p><p>Hence this is the correct option.</p></blockquote>"
